sequenceDiagram
  participant DAM as AEM DAM
  participant L as VPI launcher
  participant W as Vendor-provided-images workflow
  participant F as Filename extraction
  participant M as DAM metadata update
  participant C as Collection creation
  participant S as Salsify service
  participant R as JCR/DAM

  DAM->>L: modified original rendition under VPI path
  L->>L: evaluate MIME and excluded-event conditions
  L->>W: start workflow when conditions match
  W->>F: execute step 1
  F->>R: derive/update metadata from filename
  W->>M: execute step 2
  M->>S: update product metadata
  M->>R: commit repository changes
  W->>C: execute step 3
  C->>R: create/update DAM collection
  W->>R: Adobe workflow completion step
